### Item 3 · two small CSV leftovers (B347-8, B347-9)
**Findings (RELAYED `B347_STATUS.md:169-170`):** "**B347-8 · Note.** The CSV file name uses the UTC date (`quoteListCsv.ts:62`): a Sydney export between 00:00 and about 11:00 local is named with yesterday. Fix-shape: format the local (Sydney) date. Regression: `csvFileName(new Date('2026-10-20T20:30:00Z'))` should read `2026-10-21` (it reads `…20`)." / "**B347-9 · Note.** `termMonths` is written bare through `String()` (`quoteListCsv.ts:48`); safe only because the contract type is a number. Fix-shape: write it through the same decimal check as the counts." Source on `main` (MEASURED 23:3x): `:48` `r.termMonths === undefined ? '' : String(r.termMonths),` and `:62` `` `mps-quotes-${now.toISOString().slice(0, 10)}.csv` ``.
